{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Consider a town powered entirely by wind turbines. On a calm day, the turbines may generate little electricity. A more resilient arrangement might combine wind with solar, battery storage, grid connections and controllable generation. This allows electricity demand to be met when wind output is low. Notice that the solution does not have to rely solely on fossil fuels; it depends on the whole system.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 29.44, "words": [["Consider", 0.0], ["a", 0.685], ["town", 0.801], ["powered", 1.219], ["entirely", 1.683], ["by", 2.299], ["wind", 2.531], ["turbines.", 2.821], ["On", 3.657], ["a", 3.901], ["calm", 3.994], ["day,", 4.377], ["the", 4.841], ["turbines", 5.027], ["may", 5.666], ["generate", 5.898], ["little", 6.502], ["electricity.", 6.896], ["A", 8.243], ["more", 8.452], ["resilient", 8.719], ["arrangement", 9.427], ["might", 10.194], ["combine", 10.484], ["wind", 11.006], ["with", 11.285], ["solar,", 11.505], ["battery", 12.179], ["storage,", 12.69], ["grid", 13.41], ["connections", 13.746], ["and", 14.617], ["controllable", 14.896], ["generation.", 15.708], ["This", 16.823], ["allows", 17.124], ["electricity", 17.659], ["demand", 18.518], ["to", 18.97], ["be", 19.11], ["met", 19.284], ["when", 19.748], ["wind", 20.062], ["output", 20.398], ["is", 20.921], ["low.", 21.2], ["Notice", 21.908], ["that", 22.43], ["the", 22.674], ["solution", 22.848], ["does", 23.568], ["not", 23.847], ["have", 24.149], ["to", 24.439], ["rely", 24.636], ["solely", 25.101], ["on", 25.739], ["fossil", 25.971], ["fuels;", 26.436], ["it", 27.248], ["depends", 27.457], ["on", 27.991], ["the", 28.166], ["whole", 28.305], ["system.", 28.63]], "raw": [{"text": "Consider", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.604}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.685, "end": 0.72}, {"text": "town", "start": 0.801, "end": 1.126}, {"text": "powered", "start": 1.219, "end": 1.625}, {"text": "entirely", "start": 1.683, "end": 2